Build/download pins and hashes: core.json in this directory. The original
release uses the upstream Makefile and with_gvisor build tag; consult its
Makefile and .github/workflows for target-specific toolchain and flags.

The integration uses a local authenticated listener for AVA requests only.
It does not configure system proxy, TUN/VPN, system DNS or root certificates.
Subscription providers and server access are independently supplied by users;
no public third-party relay or Steam++ service is bundled or implicitly used.
